  "prefLabel": "Plc 302.11 Third party testing organization",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 302.11 “Third party testing organization” means any regional or national accrediting or testing organization that administers an examination that is required by applicable law for licensure in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300); ss by #14137, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 302.29); renumbered by #14305 (formerly Plc 302.10)",
